WEBVTT

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.790
Curry Bread

00:02:04.030 --> 00:02:06.700
What's the big deal?  Don't be such a hog!

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:08.450
I'm hungry, m'kay?

00:02:13.790 --> 00:02:16.940
Torako-san, I'm heading to the school shop, so...

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:20.330
Ayu, you came without a lunch today?

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:22.640
Yeah.  Today was just...

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:25.430
Then how about we go to the cafeteria together?

00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:28.750
Oh, I'm fine with some bread from the school shop, so...

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:35.150
She doesn't take no for an answer, does she?

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:44.820
The private school, Kamizono Academy, established in '56.

00:02:44.820 --> 00:02:49.090
If you combine the elementary, middle, and high schools,

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:51.270
it has a student population of more than 3,000.

00:02:52.280 --> 00:02:59.030
"To inspire talent in all directions, no matter what the field!" is the school's motto.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:57.120
Founding Principal
Nishizono

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:10.410
And here, operating during lunch-time,

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:15.450
is where the empty bellies of high school students and faculty alike are filled.

00:03:21.730 --> 00:03:24.060
No smoking in the cafeteria, you know.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.660
It's not lit, alright?

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.610
Just holding it in between my lips.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:29.300
There you go again...

00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:33.480
Smells delicious!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.310
This is the girls' cafeteria!

00:03:46.010 --> 00:03:47.620
Tatsuki-chan!

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.510
Thanks for waiting!

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.150
I was not waiting.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.630
There you go again...

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:08.630
Now then, could it be that you think of me as your friend?

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:13.060
What is she talking about?

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.560
She is completely oblivious.

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:22.820
So you buy a meal ticket first?

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:56.830
I wonder what they have?

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.820
That's quite a large menu.

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:04.530
Huh, what's this one that says "large?"

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:04.530
Large

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.050
That's a combo card.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:07.990
Combo?

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:15.530
A combo card is a card that you play at the same time as another one at the counter.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:21.890
It's an item card that increases the portion size by 50%!

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:25.110
It's compatible with anything on the menu.

00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:28.410
Well, I'm a light eater, so...

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.590
Note:  Full-moon soba, with a raw egg.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.590
I think I'll have tsukimi soba!

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:40.980
Large

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:44.170
You're cruel, just too cruel!

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:46.700
I can't eat all of this!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.970
Apologize!

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.700
Sorry!  For real, sorry!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:06:00.100
But you see, Ayu, I got a large, just like you!

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.380
That's not helping.

00:06:03.380 --> 00:06:05.980
And Suzu also got a large!

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:07.800
Why?

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.960
And she got onigiri on the side, too?

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:17.670
You didn't get a large, did you, Tatsuki-san?

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.280
Is there something amiss with that?

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:24.580
Yay, yay!  Yay, medium size!

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.570
Denied

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.170
It's delicious!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.780
What's wrong?

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.970
Ayu, you sure are cute.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:06:59.330
You're just...

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:11.110
Reeeally girly, you know...

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:19.410
See, us here, when we be eatin' soba...

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.170
It always ends up like this!

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:27.170
Damn, it's good!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:28.670
Oh, yeah!

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.970
This is what it really means to be Japanese!

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:31.340
Big Catch!

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:39.480
What are you laughin' at, you bastard?!

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:44.220
Don't go be the only one eatin' western food!

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:46.060
Hey, give that back!

00:07:46.060 --> 00:07:52.100
If it's not soba, than at least eat udon, or a katsudon, a tendon, sushi, tempura!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:56.200
If you're really my friend, show me a character that truly resonates with Japan!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:59.990
And if you really like pasta so much, damn you...

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:04.580
How about I stick some raw pasta in your mouth, and al dente you real good?!

00:08:09.800 --> 00:08:14.710
I just said something really funny, didn't I?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.650
Al dente?

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.600
That works, doesn't it?

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:38.130
I can't finish it.

00:08:38.130 --> 00:08:40.820
It's okay, just leave it.

00:08:40.820 --> 00:08:42.780
There's so much...

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:44.080
There, there.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:45.840
Speaking of which, Torako-san...

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:49.430
This is your fault, so take responsibility and finish it for her.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.000
I can't eat any more...

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.930
There's so much...

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.930
Look at you!  You have only finished as much as Ayumi did!

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.330
'Cause I'm also a light eater.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:12.480
Then, why?

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.130
I've had enough.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.250
Clean-up Eater

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:16.340
Suzu, have this.

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:17.070
Okay.

00:09:17.070 --> 00:09:19.330
Eat Ayu's, too.

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.300
Okay.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.070
But...

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:23.660
There is no need to force yourself.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:29.880
Thanks for the food.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:32.760
So she <i>is</i> the big-eater character.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.060
Torako.

00:09:35.060 --> 00:09:35.590
Yeah?

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:38.970
Can I eat a katsudon next?

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:42.800
I don't really mind...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.450
But your fuel efficiency really sucks!

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.650
She made it into a joke!

00:09:54.370 --> 00:10:00.780
Of course afterwards, all joking aside, Suzume-san ate a katsudon.

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:10.350
So you don't gain weight easily, Suzume-san?

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.480
Sure is nice...

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:16.270
I gain fat really easily.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.090
Fatty...

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:29.810
No!

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.580
Enough, stop it!

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.200
What a woman...

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:49.870
No fat

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:02.680
In art class today we'll be sketching the human body.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:07.800
Pair up with one of you being the model and the other doing a quick sketch.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:14.990
After 15 minutes we'll switch places, so try and capture the likeness of the pose quickly in your drawing.

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:17.570
All right, start.

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:22.240
Let us work well together, Suzume-san.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.320
Suzume-san, would you like to draw first?

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:28.450
No.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.800
Which one of us should go first?

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.410
I'm kind of embarrassed being a model, so...

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:42.640
Um, could ya let me cut in there?

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:45.340
Seems I'm the odd-man out here.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:48.390
I don't mind, but...

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:52.310
I'm Koma!  Kobayashi Koma.

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.690
Nice to meetcha!

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.050
You're not going to draw?

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:35.180
Indeed.  I'm going to etch this image of your body into my brain.

00:12:35.180 --> 00:12:36.500
Why?

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.530
Stop!

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.030
That!  That pose!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:52.840
Here is comes!

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.410
It's here!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:57.880
An epiphany from the goddess of art!!

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.530
You're kind of easy to draw...

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:28.180
But this is kind of...

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:36.960
Sorry!  This is just a rough sketch, so...

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:49.180
Okay, then what kind of pose should I do?

00:13:49.480 --> 00:13:50.600
What should we do?

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:53.150
Hmm, yeah...

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:59.220
Maybe something... sexy?

00:14:12.430 --> 00:14:14.920
I don't really know how.

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.780
We set our sites too high, didn't we?

00:14:16.780 --> 00:14:17.790
Yeah, we did.

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:22.790
Okay, sit here.

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.250
Sure.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:26.200
Relax you legs.

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.780
O-Okay...

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:30.150
That's it!  Glance upward!

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:31.300
O-Okay!

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:33.720
Excellent, that look is excellent!

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:38.060
Like this?

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:41.280
This is a pain!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:43.840
Take off that ribbon!

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.690
Uh, um...

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:48.020
Tora-chan, take off her shoes, too!

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:49.360
Sir, yessir!

00:14:51.630 --> 00:14:55.660
Um, is this really necessary?

00:14:58.170 --> 00:15:00.620
W-Why are you taking pictures?

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:04.810
Next, try leaning toward me.

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:07.590
I said, why are you taking pictures?!

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.430
Ooh, that's good.

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:12.450
Tora-chan, aim a bit more from the left.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:13.800
Sir, yessir!

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:16.260
Please answer my question!

00:15:16.260 --> 00:15:18.680
Ooh, I'll just take that expression you have there.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:22.690
Next, try holding your knees up close to your face.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:23.940
Answer my-

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.030
So, what was it?

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:34.110
I asked why you are taking my picture.

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:38.830
You may not realize this yourself...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.470
But you're quite popular among the boys, Yumippe.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.870
They say you're cute.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.130
"Yumippe?"

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.350
Really?

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:49.300
What does that have to do with the pictures?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:55.050
Thanks to this, it looks like my coffers are gonna be brimming.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.510
Please tell me what you intend to do with those pictures!

00:15:57.860 --> 00:15:59.160
Not so loud.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:01.000
What do you plan to do?

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:03.120
I don't plan to use them <i>myself</i>.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:05.350
What do you mean, <i>use</i> them?

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.620
Don't worry about it.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.950
What <i>are</i> they going on about?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.740
Suzume-san, have you decided on a pose?

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.110
How about a Y-balance?

00:16:16.110 --> 00:16:17.890
Y-balance?

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:18.830
Yeah.

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.210
This one.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.840
Stop, stop!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.490
Look, people can see your underwear in plain sight!

00:16:30.490 --> 00:16:32.590
Think about it for a bit!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.590
Nikaidou Hitsugi

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:34.590
Yaki-chan

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:37.550
Great, you're the best, Yumippe!

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:39.250
I can't get enough!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:43.180
Okay, time to switch models!

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:46.190
No way... We haven't drawn a thing yet.

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:48.250
What should we do next?

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.720
You wanna take pictures next?

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.620
You think I'd sell?

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.490
Sure, I think you'd sell.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:57.450
After all, you're cute, Tora-chan!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.810
For real?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:03.250
I'm a bishoujo?!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:06.750
What should I do, Master?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.040
Something like this?

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.380
Let me see...

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:15.980
How about letting your hair down?

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:17.280
My hair?

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.090
And then, loosen your necktie.

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.980
Leave it hanging on your neck.

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.560
What is going on here...

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.560
Okay!

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:30.150
So?

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.480
This is... quite...

00:17:44.490 --> 00:17:45.700
Kageyama-kun!

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:49.320
What happened to you, Kageyama-kun?!

00:17:49.320 --> 00:17:50.400
Kageyama-kun!

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:54.030
You're two... No, three times cuter than usual today!

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:54.840
Okay, I got it!

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.060
Thanks!

00:17:56.060 --> 00:17:57.270
Now, get off!

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:58.830
You're freakin' me out!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:02.880
What a naughty child you are.

00:18:02.880 --> 00:18:04.260
In a place like this...

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:05.930
Say what?!

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.640
Why are you undressing?!

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:11.010
Tora, c'mere!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.110
No!

00:18:13.110 --> 00:18:15.320
What a scoop!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.130
What a scandal!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:20.450
The class president and a disciplinary committee member are...

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:24.740
D-D-D-Don't take pictures!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:27.750
Silence!!

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:30.870
Take this seriously!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.040
Do you all think you are still in elementary school?

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:36.790
And do you not think it a problem that you have not cautioned them, teacher?

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:39.010
Uh, I don't really mind...

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:41.310
Andou-san, over there!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:42.560
Okay...

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.550
Now the rest of you, recommence sketching!

00:18:45.550 --> 00:18:46.620
I shall be your model!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:47.820
Is that acceptable?

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:49.020
Okay...

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:03.090
Boys be...

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:04.910
Boys be ambitious.

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:10.660
It's the famous quote from Dr. Clark, founder of Hokkaido University.

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:17.930
Then, what should girls be?

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:18.920
Huh?

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.070
Girls, you know... what should they be?

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.990
Loving, I guess?

00:19:26.030 --> 00:19:27.690
No, that's not it.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:29.640
Girls should be...

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:32.340
...fantastically adorable!

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.140
Note:  Torako is trying to say, "it doesn't look good" (kakkouwarui) but uses the wrong word.

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:37.140
Sorry, you look funny.

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:45.790
Man, you guys are like, totally hilarious.

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:48.010
Don't hit me for real!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:51.240
I got tons of great fresh material!

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:53.280
T-Thank you...

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:54.600
Tora-chan!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.560
Yay!

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:10.700
Maybe I should grow out my hair, too.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.910
K-Kobayashi-kun.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.350
Kobayashi-kun!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:28.180
Oh, President.

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.800
How much per photo?

00:21:30.800 --> 00:21:31.990
300 yen.

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:34.460
Buy in bulk and I'll throw in a discount.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.210
Thanks.

00:21:36.210 --> 00:21:38.890
I'll take 1 Ayumi and 3 Torako!

00:21:38.890 --> 00:21:39.730
Come again!

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:46.380
Guess business will be booming.

00:23:21.270 --> 00:23:23.170
Yuki-chan, were you nervous for your first appearance?

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:24.190
No sweat.

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:24.790
Now, time for the preview.

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:26.590
It's "A Uncanny Relationship of Tigers."

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:27.170
What does it mean?

00:23:27.170 --> 00:23:28.800
It means "mysterious encounters."

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:31.130
Students, "Try to live up to people's expectations, try fighting a tiger."

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:31.840
Long...

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:33.090
Look forward to next time too!
